{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんにちは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/13/8980388/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は\nOLにカフェにアンダーライブにラジオに\nあわあわとしております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週乗り切ろう、私！\nそして出し切ろう、私！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からアンダーライブ開幕します。\n来てくれる方はよろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この1週間は握手会が\n名古屋、京都、東京でありました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/13/8980388/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋ではアルバムの\nスペシャル個別ということで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部 生まれたままで\n2部 ガールズルール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を着たよ〜〜*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/13/8980388/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この衣装は私至上最高の挑戦！(◎_◎;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都では\n11枚目の最初の個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部2部と朝早くから\nたくさんの方が来てくれて\n嬉しかったですm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/13/8980388/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服はカジュアル目で\nOLの休日って感じでした〜。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は畠中さんの\n卒業セレモニーもありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"畠中さんのサバサバした所、\n大好きでしたm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄くお世話になったし\n思い出はたくさんあるな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもライブとか\n遊びに来て下さいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業おめでとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日は東京でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東圏の握手会久しぶりだから\n緊張した！(◎_◎;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も1部2部3部とお洋服変えたよん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/13/8980388/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれがお好みだったかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは2部の！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/13/8980388/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅延などのトラブルもありましたが、\nたくさんの方が来てくれて\n嬉しかったですm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ\n乃木坂カフェ\nまいちゅんカフェ\n王様のブランチ\n埼玉ウォーカー\nヤンジャン\n次週のヤンマガグラビア\nOLの新年度について"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなど話すことがたくさんあって\n充実してました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/13/8980388/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださって\n本当にありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったです♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこの日は\n深川さんの生誕祭や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松井玲奈さんの\nセレモニーもありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも後日改めて書きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は5/2横浜！待ってますね〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/13/8980388/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【告知】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/9 週間ヤングジャンプ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーメンバーで\nまさかの表紙をやらせて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感無量です（ ;  ; ）\n夢だったから本当に嬉しい（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"週間発売により\n買えるのが明後日まででなので\nお早めに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/13 ヤングマガジン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて紙面単独グラビアを\nさせて頂きました（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとやりたいな〜と思ってたので、\n撮影は本当に幸せでした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OL感満載のグラビアに\nなってますので、\n是非よろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つらつらと近況を\n書いてきましたが、今日はこの辺で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"王様のブランチ見てくれた人〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/13/8980388/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！"}],"source":"archive"}